{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"90255","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/90255","key":"MC-58961","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"25/Jun/14 9:12 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>In short, this bug is simply that the 'back' button on the multiplayer kick message screen can overlap with the kick message itself, if the message is approximately 9 lines or more. (Attached is a screenshot which shows this better).</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Start a server.</li>\n\t<li>Set your GUI Scale to 3/auto.</li>\n\t<li>Go into the console and run:\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>/kick @s \n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>→ <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Text will appear behind the \"Back\" button. (Note: In newer versions the text appears in front of the \"Back\" button, which is not much better either.)</p></li>\n</ol>\n","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"14/Jan/18 7:10 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/117500","id":"117500","filename":"2018-09-17_00.26.15.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.n